/**
 * Microsoft Clarity.
 *
 * WHAT USED TO BE HERE, AND WHY IT ISN'T
 *
 * This component also carried the Google Ads tag hardcoded — the gtag.js
 * loader for AW-16946176869, its config call, the call conversion
 * (jqC8COOXo64aEOXGyJA_) with the (416) 244-6497 number swap, and the form
 * conversion (cnvWCPKRo64aEOXGyJA_) fired on /thank-you/. They were ported
 * verbatim from the live WordPress page so the cutover would be invisible in
 * the Ads account.
 *
 * The landing page no longer loads GTM either. Container GTM-NMTLRJ63 belongs
 * to the main site, rexdalemobilewash.ca, and this build used to load the same
 * one — which is how the Google tag kept appearing here after the snippet went.
 * It was removed from this site rather than paused in GTM, so the main site
 * keeps its container and its tag. See the note in Base.astro.
 *
 * Net effect: nothing on lp.rexdalemobilewash.ca reports Google Ads
 * conversions. Not the base tag, not the call conversion, not the form
 * conversion. If Ads reporting is ever wanted back on this page it needs its
 * own container or its own snippet — deliberately, and in one place only.
 *
 * Clarity stays hardcoded: it is not an Ads tag, has no double-counting
 * hazard (a second copy of the same project id is de-duplicated by the tag
 * itself), and nothing about it depends on the container.
 */
---

